+                     "[streaming] %s graph read complete=%u status=%u eax=%08x claimed=%u "
+                     "failure=%u\n",
+                     label, unsigned(loaded.complete), unsigned(loaded.guest.status),
+                     loaded.guest.eax, unsigned(journal.fully_claimed()),
