+
+`browser_viewport.cpp` is a native adapter for the pinned executable, supplied
+through `[translate].native` and `browser_overrides.h`. The host publishes a
+paired CSS width/height snapshot; only the guest thread mutates guest memory.
+The canvas uses 100vw/100dvh and SDL mirrors its CSS extent. A guest display
+mode change leaves browser CSS sizing intact and updates logical pointer mapping.
+The DirectDraw shim admits one bounded transient mode, without adding resize
+history to the game's fixed-capacity enumerated mode vector.
