+The adapter hash-checks the owned `UIData_1920_1080.dat`, transforms the measured
+APMK/APdb anchors, and writes a transient layout in the profile overlay. Dynamic
+sizes use a uniform scale with an 800×600 minimum logical layout, at most 8192
+on either axis. Automatic mode follows CSS pixels; original Graphics presets
+select a preferred logical height while width follows browser aspect. A separate
+`browser-viewport.txt` stores that preference; the original confirmation timeout
+call at 00463439 restores the previous preference. The label call at 004630c9 becomes Fit browser (automatic) for 800×600
+and render-quality labels for the other presets. Loading phase 2 and the native
+resolution confirmation modal defer automatic rebuilding.
